{% set routeFact = trip.evidence.facts | selectattr("id", "equalto", "route-readiness") | first %}
<section id="recommendation-readiness" class="divider evidence-section">
  <div class="section-label"><p class="eyebrow">How It Stacks Up</p><h2>What works well—and what still needs checking</h2><p>The score reflects how well this trip fits the family. Flight schedules, live prices, and availability still need a fresh check before booking.</p></div>
  <div class="evidence-summary-grid">
    <article><span>Family-fit score</span><strong>{{ trip.main.scorecard.totalBaked }}/50</strong><p>Value matters most in the score; PTO is shown separately.</p></article>
    <article><span>Before you book</span><strong>{{ routeFact["value"]["status"] | replace("-", " ") | title }}</strong><p>{{ routeFact.confidence | title }} confidence · recheck by {{ (routeFact.expiresAt | displayDate) if routeFact.expiresAt else "when the schedule or route changes" }}</p></article>
    <article><span>How solid are the estimates?</span><strong>{{ trip.evidence.overallConfidence | title }}</strong><p>Reviewed {{ trip.evidence.reviewedAt | displayDate }}.{% if trip.evidence.overallConfidence != "high" and trip.evidence.limitingAxes.length %} The least certain areas are {{ trip.evidence.limitingAxes | join(", ") }}.{% endif %}</p></article>
    <article><span>Expected family total</span><strong>{% if trip.main.scorecard.budget.ceilUsd <= 12000 %}At/below target{% elif trip.main.scorecard.budget.ceilUsd <= 15000 %}Within $15k preference{% elif trip.main.scorecard.budget.floorUsd <= 15000 %}Range crosses $15k{% else %}Likely above $15k{% endif %}</strong><p>{{ trip.main.scorecard.budget.floorUsd | moneyK }}&ndash;{{ trip.main.scorecard.budget.ceilUsd | moneyK }} estimated range.</p></article>
  </div>
  <details class="verification-log">
    <summary>See recent planning updates</summary>
    <ul>{%- for event in verificationLog.events -%}{% if event.scope == "all" or event.scope == trip.slug %}<li><time datetime="{{ event.date }}">{{ event.date }}</time> &mdash; {{ event.summary }}</li>{% endif %}{%- endfor -%}</ul>
  </details>
</section>
